### status
GET {{baseUrl}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

### live
GET {{baseUrl}}/live
Content-Type: application/json

### ready
GET {{baseUrl}}/ready
Content-Type: application/json

### health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Content-Type: application/json


### token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/token
Content-Type: application/json


{
  "username": "user",
  "password": "pass"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.token);
%}


### perms
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### create template
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/box
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "payload": {
    "service": "example",
    "stage": {
      "development": {
        "template": {
          "name": "template-example.json",
          "value": ""
        }
      }
    }
  }
}


### create (v2) task-def [OK]
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/box/example-ecs1/development/task-definition.json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": ""
}

### create (v2) task-def [ERR]
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/box/example-ecs1/development/task-definition.json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": ""
}


### get all boxes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/box
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json



### template stage
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/box/example-ecs1/development
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

