HEAD {{baseUrl}}/api/box/example-yaml/development/template-example.yaml
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json


### get template
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/box/example-ecs1/development/task-definition.json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json


### vars template
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/box/example-ecs1/development/task-definition.json/vars
