### ListSchemaTypes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/box/schemas
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json



### create
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/entry
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {"key": "global/example/var001", "value": "var en dynamodb v5"},
  {"key": "global/example/var-ultra-secret", "value": "var en dynamodb v5", "secure": true},
  {"key": "global/example/var-ultra-secret2", "value": "var en dynamodb v5.1", "secure": true},
  {"key": "development/serverless/url-example", "value": "valor en parameter store v5"},
  {"key": "development/example/name", "value": "nbox v1"},
  {"key": "passbox/vault-1", "value": "pass ultra secret v5"}
]

### create passbox
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/entry
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {"key": "passbox/av2/account-pepe", "value": "usando nats ok 2.3"}
]


### testing create
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/entry
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "key": "global/example/debug",
    "value": "active"
  },
  {
    "key": "global/example/new-secure-1",
    "value": "ooohh",
    "secure": true
  },
  {
    "key": "global/example/new-secure-2",
    "value": "ooohh",
    "secure": true
  },
  {
    "key": "global/example/unique-key7",
    "value": "secret-1234",
    "secure": true
  }
]


### Get key
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/entry/key?v=development/example/name
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json


### retrieve secret value
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/entry/resolve?v=global/github-actions/github-npm-auth-token
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json


### retrieve many keys
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/entry/lookup
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  "production/prometeo/access_token_coinag_api_ar",
  "production/prometeo/alfin_client_id",
  "production/prometeo/alfin_client_secret"
]



### Get prefix
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/entry/prefix?v=/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Get prefix clean
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/entry/prefix?v=beta/&leaves
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### list tracking history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/track/key?v=passbox/vault-1&from=15d
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}



### all stages
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/static/stages
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### all environments
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/static/environments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete key
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/entry/key?v=developmentexample/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json



### Export entries
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/entry/export?prefix=global/example&format=json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json



### List all Prefix config
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/prefix
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json



### Resolve Prefix config
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/prefix/resolve?v=production/nats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json



### Backends Prefix config
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/prefix/backends
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json


### boxspec Resolve (export JSON Schema)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/boxspec/resolve?pattern=task-definition1.json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json


### boxspec List
GET {{baseUrl}} /api/boxspec/specs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json


### boxspec reload
POST {{baseUrl}} /api/boxspec/reload
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### boxspec validate task-definition.json
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/boxspec/validate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "filename": "task-definition.json",
  "content": ""
}
